# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model — OpenRouter
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by agent/agent.ts. Without it the first model call fails (the build
# still succeeds — the key is not asserted at module scope).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free. Swap in a stronger
# model here without touching code — the free tier is weak at long tool loops.
OPENROUTER_MODEL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deployment — read by agent/tools/deploy_static_site.ts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel personal or team token. Lives in the app runtime only; it is never
# passed into the sandbox and the model never sees it.
VERCEL_TOKEN=
# Only needed when deploying into a team rather than a personal account.
VERCEL_TEAM_ID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Route auth (agent/channels/eve.ts, framework default)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The scaffold's default auth chain rejects production HTTP callers. Replace
# placeholderAuth() before exposing this agent to a browser.
